Source: supersprinter
Maintainer: piotreknow02 <kontakt@piotreknow.dev>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/piotreknow02/supersprinter

Package: supersprinter
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, libvulkan1 | libegl1, libxkbcommon0
Recommends: hicolor-icon-theme
Description: RSVP speed reader
 Supersprinter is a rapid serial visual presentation (RSVP) speed reader.
 It shows text one word at a time at a fixed pivot point, either in a GUI
 window or exported to a video file.
